@startuml
title Storyteller Image Flow

start
:Receive /image instruction;
:Read image from desktop clipboard;
if (PNG available?) then (yes)
  :Encode transient PNG data URL;
  :Build multimodal user message;
  :Send through chat resilience guard;
  :Receive draft response;
  if (validation enabled?) then (yes)
    :Validate using instruction and response text only;
    :Select allowed draft or replacement;
  endif
  :Persist instruction and final response text;
  note right
  Image bytes are never written to history,
  summaries, canonical state, or exports.
  end note
  :Queue text-only derived-memory updates;
  :Print final response;
else (no)
  :Print local image command error;
endif
stop
@enduml
